169,79.965 553.369,79.82 C556.562,79.673 558.743,79.167 560.652,78.425 C562.623,77.658 564.297,76.634 565.965,74.965 C567.633,73.296 568.659,71.625 569.425,69.651 C570.167,67.743 570.674,65.562 570.82,62.369 C570.966,59.17 571,58.147 571,50 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\"></path></g></g></g></svg></div><div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\"><div style=\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div></div><div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\"><div><div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div><div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div><div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"><div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div><div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"><div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div><div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div><div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div><div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DcxTUBWlHz2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p></div></blockquote><p></p><p>The news of Aurelius was broken by Lennon’s half-brother Julian. In a swiftly-deleted Facebook message, he spoke about a recent visit to London before announcing the news.</p><blockquote><div>But I think as lovely and wonderful as this little visit was… the most amazing thing that happened this weekend, in the whole wide world, was that I became an uncle! Congratulations to Sean &amp; Charlotte, and their new ‘Beautiful Boy’! Only Love ❤️</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Julian Lennon</div><p>In total, Aurelius is the 19th Beatles grandchild. His arrival means each of the four Beatles would have become grandparents. <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a> was the first, when his eldest son Zak Starkey became a parent to Tatia in September 1985. Starr currently has nine grandchildren –&nbsp;two to Zak and four to second son Jason, plus triplets born to daughter Lee. In August 2016 Starr became the first Beatle great-grandfather when Zak’s daughter Tatia gave birth to a son, Stone.</p><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> became a grandfather in April 1999 when his daughter Mary gave birth to son Arthur. McCartney currently has eight grandchildren&nbsp;–&nbsp;four each born to his daughters Mary and Stella.</p><p>Like John Lennon, <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> did not become a grandfather within his lifetime. His son Dhani became a parent to daughter Lilou Mizu in 2025.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/09/02/sean-lennon-announces-aurelius-birth-baby-son/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-142912 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTYwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-160x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Sean Lennon and Charlotte Kemp Muhl with son Aurelius\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-160x200.jpg 160w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-464x580.jpg 464w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-768x960.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-1228x1536.jpg 1228w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01.jpg 1402w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" data-attachment-id=\"142914\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1402,1753\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Sean Lennon and Charlotte Kemp Muhl with son Aurelius\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/260902-sean-lennon-aurelius_01-768x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure cla