r Band live: Walmart Arkansas Music Pavilion, Rogers</a></li><li>2014: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2014/09/02/george-harrison-apple-years-1968-75-box-set-announced/\">George Harrison: The Apple Years 1968-75 box set announced</a></li><li>2013: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2013/09/02/six-beatles-albums-granted-platinum-status-uk-bpi/\">Six Beatles albums granted platinum status in the UK</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/09/02/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-britt-festival-pavilion-jacksonville/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Britt Festival Pavilion, Jacksonville</a></li><li>2001: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2001/09/02/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-sdsu-open-air-theatre-san-diego/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: SDSU Open Air Theatre, San Diego</a></li><li>1998: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1998/09/02/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-stadtpark-freilichtbuhne-hamburg-2/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Stadtpark Freilichtbühne, Hamburg</a></li><li>1992: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1992/09/02/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-park-west-park-city/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Park West, Park City</a></li><li>1989: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1989/09/02/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-pacific-amphitheatre-costa-mesa/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Pacific Amphitheatre, Costa Mesa</a></li><li>1978: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1978/09/02/george-harrison-marries-olivia-arias/\">George Harrison marries Olivia Arias</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/09/02/recording-c-moon-wings/\">Recording: C Moon by Wings</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/09/02/tape-copying-all-things-must-pass-george-harrison/\">Tape copying: All Things Must Pass by George Harrison</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/09/02/live-convention-hall-philadelphia/\">The Beatles live: Convention Hall, Philadelphia</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/09/02/live-cavern-club-liverpool-225/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/09/02/live-aintree-institute-liverpool-25/\">The Beatles live: Aintree Institute, Liverpool</a></li><li>1960: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1960/09/02/live-indra-club-hamburg-17/\">The Beatles live: Indra Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div>",
  "textContent": "Sean Lennon and his partner Charlotte Kemp Muhl have announced the birth of their baby boy Aurelius. The child is the first grandson of John Lennon and Yoko Ono. Ono’s daughter Kyoko Chan Cox has a daughter, Emi, and son, Jack, born in 1997 and 2000 respectively. View this post on InstagramSean Lennon, 50,  and Charlotte Kemp Muhl, 39, have been together since 2007. She has worked as a model, filmmaker, and musician, performing with St Vincent and Uni And The Urchins, and with Lennon in The Ghost Of A Saber Tooth Tiger. The couple also founded the record label Chimera Music.We made a human! Am convinced DNA is agentic alien quaternary code.\nThe sleep deprivation only adds to the surrealism…Burping technique tips welcome.\nBeen playing him Aphex Twin and Stravinsky.\nMeconium is crazyCharlotte Kemp Muhl\nInstagram View this post on InstagramThe news of Aurelius was broken by Lennon’s half-brother Julian. In a swiftly-deleted Facebook message, he spoke about a recent visit to London before announcing the news.But I think as lovely and wonderful as this little visit was… the most amazing thing that happened this weekend, in the whole wide world, was that I became an uncle! Congratulations to Sean & Charlotte, and their new ‘Beautiful Boy’! Only Love ❤️Julian LennonIn total, Aurelius is the 19th Beatles grandchild. His arrival means each of the four Beatles would have become grandparents. Ringo Starr was the first, when his eldest son Zak Starkey became a parent to Tatia in September 1985. Starr currently has nine grandchildren – two to Zak and four to second son Jason, plus triplets born to daughter Lee. In August 2016 Starr became the first Beatle great-grandfather when Zak’s daughter Tatia gave birth to a son, Stone.Paul McCartney became a grandfather in April 1999 when his daughter Mary gave birth to son Arthur. McCartney currently has eight grandchildren – four each born to his daughters Mary and Stella.Like John Lennon, George Harrison did not become a grandfather within his lifetime. His son Dhani became a parent to daughter Lilou Mizu in 2025.\n\n\nPage last updated: 3 September 2026Also on this day...2018: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Walmart Arkansas Music Pavilion, Rogers2014: George Harrison: The Apple Years 1968-75 box set announced2013: Six Beatles albums granted platinum status in the UK2003: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Britt Festival Pavilion, Jacksonville2001: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: SDSU Open Air Theatre, San Diego1998: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Stadtpark Freilichtbühne, Hamburg1992: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Park West, Park City1989: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Pacific Amphitheatre, Costa Mesa1978: George Harrison marries Olivia Arias1972: Recording: C Moon by Wings1970: Tape copying: All Things Must Pass by George Harrison1964: The Beatles live: Convention Hall, Philadelphia1962: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)1961: The Beatles live: Aintree Institute, Liverpool1960: The Beatles live: Indra Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
